# turtles_pro 1.58 - drafted by port_tool.py from turtles_pro-1.59.port (item 137): every
# function and global placed, shots copied (the same title). tick matched loosely: 1.58's tick
# checks event 0x33 where 1.59's checks 0x37 - the only function of that shape in the program.
# Like 1.59, no lights, screens or clips.
game           turtles_pro
version        1.58

# ---- functions: site <name> <address> <first two instruction words> --------------------
#   tick: located (loose)
site tick             0x003cf2ec 0xe92d4038 0xe3a00033
